WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.924
Theo: I didn't make this mess. I promise!

2
00:00:05.925 --> 00:00:11.300
Riley: It was a chicken! She ripped open the

3
00:00:11.301 --> 00:00:16.201
bag. She was taking all the feed.

4
00:00:16.202 --> 00:00:21.390
Sarah: She's a bully! We put her in jail.

5
00:00:21.391 --> 00:00:25.600
Well, it was just a cage.

6
00:00:25.601 --> 00:00:28.929
Mack: You must be talking about Betsy.

7
00:00:28.930 --> 00:00:33.504
She's at the top of the pecking order. Ben:

8
00:00:33.505 --> 00:00:38.174
Oh! That means she's the chickens' leader, right?

9
00:00:38.175 --> 00:00:42.516
Mack: Yes. But she didn't make this mess.

10
00:00:42.517 --> 00:00:47.237
She can't open the shed door. Sarah:

11
00:00:47.238 --> 00:00:50.969
I wonder who made the mess then.

12
00:00:50.970 --> 00:00:53.809
Ben: Let's look for clues.

13
00:00:53.810 --> 00:00:56.974
Riley: Maybe it's a snake.

14
00:00:56.975 --> 00:01:00.822
We saw something moving in the hay. Ben:

15
00:01:00.823 --> 00:01:04.384
Hmm. I see some tracks.

16
00:01:04.385 --> 00:01:09.098
And they aren't from a snake. Theo:

17
00:01:09.099 --> 00:01:12.787
These look like Whiskers' tracks. And

18
00:01:12.788 --> 00:01:18.029
I know what's like a hamster—a mouse! Skyler: Maybe

19
00:01:18.030 --> 00:01:22.246
that's what was in the hay! Mack:

20
00:01:22.247 --> 00:01:25.672
There are mice all over the farm. Sarah:

21
00:01:25.673 --> 00:01:31.435
Eek! I hope one is not in here now. Mack:

22
00:01:31.436 --> 00:01:40.598
I need a cat. Cats hunt mice.

23
00:01:40.599 --> 00:01:47.228
Theo's mom: No collar or tag. This cat is definitely a stray.

24
00:01:47.229 --> 00:01:51.250
I've seen her around for a few months. Theo:

25
00:01:51.251 --> 00:01:54.593
Mack will be so happy. Riley:

26
00:01:54.594 --> 00:02:02.436
Maybe he'll even smile. Mack:

27
00:02:02.437 --> 00:02:05.343
Thanks for bringing the cat last night. I

28
00:02:05.344 --> 00:02:10.104
named her Fang. She'll be a big help. Theo:

29
00:02:10.105 --> 00:02:15.309
No problem. Where is she now? Mack:

30
00:02:15.310 --> 00:02:20.719
Look in the shed. Riley:

31
00:02:20.720 --> 00:02:25.856
Fang is sleeping on the bags of chicken feed!

32
00:02:25.857 --> 00:02:31.166
Theo: She's guarding them. Good job, Fang!

33
00:02:31.167 --> 00:02:35.907
Kids: Ha-ha!

